# 5. Exact desktop Playground layout

Design and validate against a typical desktop viewport of 1920 × 1080, while supporting smaller laptop displays.

Use a viewport-constrained application shell based on `100dvh`, CSS Grid or Flexbox, and correct `min-height: 0` and overflow handling.

The global application shell must not grow unnecessarily when terminal output, history, or documentation becomes longer.

## Proposed layout

```text
