Users must be able to repeat each relevant lesson on their own machines.

A Vercel-hosted browser application cannot ordinarily execute arbitrary shell commands on visitors' computers. Do not pretend otherwise.

Create a dedicated **Real-Machine Practice** mode distinct from the Browser Simulation.

